@seq 2
@entry ROUTE
∀ agent: depth(agent) ≤ 2
∀ gate: retry(gate, ADV ∨ DENY) ≤ 3
⊥ retry_exhausted(gate) → 🧾 Trouble(gate, latest_advisory_or_denial) → 🧑 Human → End(Conversation) ⊣ ⊤

🔎 PRECEDENT
Obj(Task{task_id,target,acceptance}) → Mor(llm-mem.search[level=2,json]) → Precedents
HIT ⇒ Evidence(memory=Precedents) → ROUTE
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(memory=N_A(no_precedent)) → ROUTE
ERROR ∨ missing_executable ⇒ Evidence(memory=FAILED(non_secret_cause)) → ROUTE

🔀 ROUTE
RO_LOCAL ∧ valid_local_review ⇒ LOCAL_REVIEW
explicit(research-local) ⇒ RESEARCH_LOCAL
otherwise ⇒ RESEARCH → CHANGE → FINISH
LOCAL_REVIEW ⇒ load(research-local.seq)
RESEARCH ⇒ load(research.seq)
CHANGE ⇒ load(change.seq)
FINISH ⇒ load(finish.seq)
